  "prefLabel": "Env-Wt 1003.02 Registration Fee and Documents Required",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wt 1003.02 Registration Fee and Documents Required. The following documents and evidence shall be considered evidence that the docking structure(s) meets the qualifying criteria in RSA 482‑A:3, IV‑a,(b)(1):\n\n(a) The permit number issued under RSA 482-A or its predecessor statutes and a copy of the approved plan authorizing the construction of the docking structures being registered;\n\n(b) Professionally prepared plans showing that the docking structures existed in the same size, location, and configuration since January 1, 2000;\n\n(c) Any combination of documents, including but not limited to dated photographs, tax cards, deeds, aerial images, or invoices, that clearly demonstrate that the docking structure has existed in its current size, location, and configuration since January 1, 2000; or\n\n(d) The registration number issued to the previous owner of the docking structures if the registration has been invalidated by the transfer of the property.\n\nSource. #13210, INTERIM, eff 6-15-21; ss by #13314, eff 12-21-21",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-wt1000.html"
